Package: animalreflect
Title: Integration of 3D Animal Models with Hyperspectral Imaging and Solar Geometry
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Integrates 3D animal models (OBJ format) with hyperspectral images (SPE format) 
    to extract projection surfaces based on solar angles, and retrieves reflectance data 
    on specific wavebands. Supports time-varying solar position calculations and outputs 
    projection surfaces as GeoTIFF files.
